      translation: "And We did certainly send Musa with Our signs and a clear authority To Pharaoh, Haman and Qarun, but they said, \"[He is] a magician and a liar.\" And when he brought them the truth from Us, they said, \"Kill the sons of those who have believed with him and keep their women alive.\" But the plan of the disbelievers is not except in error. And Pharaoh said, \"Let me kill Musa and let him call upon his Lord. Indeed, I fear that he will change your religion or that he will cause corruption in the land.\" But Musa said, \"Indeed, I have sought refuge in my Lord and your Lord from every arrogant one who does not believe in the Day of Account.\"",
