      arabicText: "وَمِن قَوْمِ مُوسَىٰٓ أُمَّةٌ يَهْدُونَ بِٱلْحَقِّ وَبِهِۦ يَعْدِلُونَ",
      translation: "And among the people of Musa is a community which guides by truth and by it establishes justice.",
